title: Bombay, Mumbai (2025)
permalink: bombay-mumbai-2025
date: 2025-11-22
release_artist: Rishi Vanukuru

more_label: About

-- synopsis
A song from another life, not so far in the past.
-- synopsis

-- more
I began writing this song in Fall 2019. It is now Fall 2025.   

Bombay is the old name of the city now called Mumbai.

Words:

Bombay  
Was where you said hey there  
Hello  
Here's my story, what's yours?  
And I hoped that we'd become  
The best of friends  

And that someday  
Not so far in the future  
In fact, maybe sooner  
We'd laugh, and joke  
About the day we met  

How I stood there for seconds  
And didn't say a word  
An unusual pause  
That you now know me for  
We shook hands that once  
And never needed to again  

It's been years since that day  
And months since you called  
I'm still in Bombay  
But you're so much more  
Now how do I speak through  
This silence to reach you  
Old friend  

Frankly it's hard  
To live with reminiscence  
I hide from shadows and memories  
Silhouettes scare me  
When I keep expecting your footsteps  
Everywhere  

Frankly it's hard  
Dealing with dissonance  
Do I remind you of times    
you can't wait to forget  
I wish I  
Was anywhere else  
But in Mumbai  

Mumbai   
Was where you said    
You had to go  
Where I could not follow  
I failed and then I swore  
To try again  

So that someday  
Not so far in the future  
I hope, even sooner  
I could forget this place and  
The day you left  

How we stood there for seconds   
And didn't say a word   
I pretended to smile  
It probably worked  
You looked back just once  
And never needed to again  

It's been years since that day  
And months since you called  
I'm still in Bombay  
But you're so much more  
Oh how do I speak through   
This distance to reach you  
Old friend  

Frankly it's hard  
To live with reminiscence  
I hide from shadows and memories  
Silhouettes scare me  
When I keep expecting your footsteps  
Everywhere  

Frankly it's hard  
Dealing with dissonance  
Do I remind you of times   
you can't wait to forget  
I wish I  
Was anywhere else  
But in Mumbai  

Bombay was where you said hey there  
And Mumbai was where you said goodbye  

Bombay was where we said hey there  
And Mumbai was where we said goodbye  

-- more

